e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QovK3wql4hcQ7kNvwHcVOzh&_nc_oc=AdrYnX9P9G7YHD7EvnAM5KaDUsNI-I_orOk_iUPLYlwvpuG0_L7BGoqxSedlMgm6L4w&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGG5xtS10VQ3afSKHcXI-DjgtNE7R9jwZ2GBTC2CLBecg&oe=6A79B139"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=l3nESBe8ZRYQ7kNvwG2vxOI&_nc_oc=Adr9gUDzyOoEiNSjoE4C69A3bCbE-pqKY4VXYMDv6Uc8OMtBpiY8Xg6ZrnvVYIR_tpg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE-M2nXEqYh_xqrDu46qCYHgDZA6TVtF5zzHZh12PvHKA&oe=6A79C0D3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8XMKaCOR5pQQ7kNvwFrtU31&_nc_oc=Adq8ombV8AjH_k4kiuZrvzQpVRRMzQfGb-GdwX2JIBFPpnGNFTMTd8LlrR6juvwAGKQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQELwcymnOulzdUxhPJdSQdh96EVkvfLJ85fnHp7mUUwCg&oe=6A79CC7B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=MZOFAT_yLEAQ7kNvwEpBTvp&_nc_oc=AdocsHWW-tq4mvBK0ZCYqWmDCBkin1CQgDOBED5DGHUq6jgJZA4kC4eIULrP3mLZiWQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHyrNP08K9Gjhx5zcMJp8nyjsKaJZA9afUTPxv6OZIHKA&oe=6A79CDCA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lpEMhjmnq9kQ7kNvwEZz0yz&_nc_oc=AdqliF6uZ8oZc9_J-_S7XIF0umq7Jh4AK1xxC9U9JNV4j26DsABrbNORQ5fufPF1Y6M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGDAQE-bnv1FsDHEzg469Sw92BkudHudOBSD-koiDU-PQ&oe=6A79B6FE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se